OL,5,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,6,     FEdith Bowman talks to Sir
OL,7,     FChristopher Nolan about The
OL,8,     FOdyssey, and composer Anna
OL,9,     FMeredith looks at Ludwig
OL,10,     FGoransson's score to Nolan's 2020
OL,11,     Fsci-fi thriller Tenet.
OL,12,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,13,     FJess swaps favourite music with
OL,14,     Fthe conductor Dalia Stasevska,
OL,15,     Fincluding music by Walton and
OL,16,     FBach, Dalia's favourite Sibelius
OL,17,     Fsymphony and her organ-based
OL,18,     Fguilty pleasure.
